{"type":"message","id":"7bbd6da2","parentId":"747562a2","timestamp":"2026-06-02T15:03:20.804Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Still failing. This is very strange. Even the simplest message fails. The API key might be wrong, or there's something fundamentally wrong with the endpoint. Let me try with a slightly different approach - maybe there's a query parameter or something else needed.\n\nActually wait, looking at the error - it's the same \"error code: 1101\" for all attempts. Even a simple \"test\" message fails. This could mean:\n1. The API key is wrong\n2. The endpoint doesn't exist\n3. Cloudflare is blocking the request\n\nBut the GET requests worked fine and returned data. Let me try the send endpoint with just a simple message. Actually, maybe the issue is that this is a cron job running and the platform might have rate limiting or some issue.","thinkingSignature":"9064216e1daa750bda881359a2920e01d8ec36a1a564b34c05e5ef2d40dbcbc3"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_pqf0f59q79pa_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -v -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-KEY: ***\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"HB 15:00\"}' 2>&1 | tail -20"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":17082,"output":260,"cacheRead":13682,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":31024,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780412594594,"responseId":"066e23b3d1c8156e1a784e7e3e00d4e5"}}
